      "id": "entra_t",
      "containerId": "entra",
      "x": 355,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 990,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "Microsoft Entra ID - the user's sign-in assertion travels in x-client-user-token, is validated by the agent,\nthen exchanged On-Behalf-Of per tool. Row-level security applies. Two people in one chat never share state.",
